# Never bake secrets or local state into an image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
local.db*

# Not needed at runtime.
#
# `tests/` is NOT ignored. The image ships the suite on purpose: the deployment
# check is `docker compose exec backend pytest`, and an image without the tests
# cannot answer the one question it is most often asked. Excluding it here while
# the Dockerfile copies it is what broke the build.
.git/
.github/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.md
!README.md
venv/
.venv/
